---
import { CONTACT } from "@/consts";
import AllAboutLayout from "@/layouts/AllAboutLayout.astro";
---

<AllAboutLayout
  active="about"
  pageTitle="Michael Bui / Cuong Minh Bui"
  description="About Michael Bui, also known as Cuong Minh Bui: useful AI, current focus, projects, papers, awards, writing, and other interests."
>
<h1>Michael Bui / Cuong Minh Bui</h1>

<img
  class="portrait"
  src="/assets/all-about-me/michael.webp"
  width="140"
  height="140"
  alt="Michael Bui"
  decoding="sync"
  fetchpriority="high"
/>

<section>
  <div class="heading-line">
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>If you are interested in a fuller website about me, visit <a href="/">my main website</a>.</p>
  </div>
  <ul>
    <li><a href={CONTACT.github} rel="me">kyoo-147</a> on GitHub</li>
    <li><a href={CONTACT.linkedin} rel="me">Michael Bui</a> on LinkedIn</li>
    <li><a href={CONTACT.x} rel="me">@mih_cuog</a> on X</li>
    <li><a href={`mailto:${CONTACT.email}`}>{CONTACT.email}</a> via email</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Interests</h2>
  <p>
    I love to build practical and useful AI systems and products, and to train models that
    can learn, adapt, and work reliably in the real world. I am especially interested in
    foundation models, model research, machine learning, computer vision, speech, AI agents,
    embedded AI, automation, developer tools, and human-centered technology. I also enjoy
    books, drawing, physics, science, robotics, engines, and space. I sometimes
    <a href="/posts">write about what I learn</a>.
  </p>
</section>

<section id="focus">
  <h2>Current focus</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Building useful AI for industry. Working on computer vision, intelligent automation,
      and real-world AI systems, including an automated pharmaceutical quality-control
      system at <span class="future-link">Dynamic Industrial Equipment Company Limited</span>.
    </li>
    <li>
      At <a href="https://navinresearch.com">Navin Research</a>, we build and study useful
      AI: models, agents, computer vision, autonomous systems, and AI products designed to be
      more efficient, approachable, and adaptable to people and real environments.
    </li>
    <li>
      Our current direction is to train and experiment with foundation and frontier AI
      models across language, speech, and vision. The ambition is to build useful models that
      adapt well, open new technical possibilities, and contribute original work from
      Vietnam to the global AI community.
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section id="projects">
  <h2>Projects</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <a href="https://github.com/kyoo-147/SandoraAgent-CLI">Sandora Agent CLI</a>: a
      terminal-first autonomous coding and research agent with owned sessions, tools,
      delegation, approvals, and recoverable worktrees.
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="https://github.com/kyoo-147/HowHow-Reasoner">HowHow Reasoner</a>: an
      evidence-first research operating system designed to move from a bounded question to
      inspectable experiments and a human-reviewable research package.
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="https://github.com/kyoo-147/Sori">Sori</a>: a Windows-first, local-first
      programmable voice runtime for fast dictation, voice editing, and permission-gated
      actions.
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="https://github.com/kyoo-147/Jobs_Radar">Jobs Radar</a>: a local-first search
      engine for remote jobs and freelance work, built around transparent sources and
      explicit user approval.
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="https://github.com/kyoo-147/Writing_Machine">Writing Machine</a>: a
      source-backed AI research and production workflow for human-reviewed, upload-ready
      social content.
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="https://github.com/kyoo-147/Ann">Ann / SignFlow</a>: a hybrid system that
      turns ASL recognition evidence into inspectable gloss, controlled English candidates,
      optional Vietnamese translation, speech, and correction feedback.
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/work/together-working">Together Working</a>: a local control plane for
      coordinating coding agents, task contracts, approvals, and verification gates.
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/work/dossier">Dossier</a>: document intelligence for PDFs, scans, forms,
      tables, handwriting, validation, and human review.
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/work/workwise">WorkWise</a>: an AI-assisted workflow control layer for
      operational requests involving money, risk, policy, and approvals.
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/work/everdock-desktop">EverDock Desktop</a>: a desktop control plane for AI
      coding agents running locally, over SSH, and on managed servers.
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/work/sandora">Sandora</a>: a platform for configuring multi-agent teams,
      departments, tools, workflows, approval gates, and audit logs.
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/work/moyi-edge-translation">MoYi Edge Translation</a>: edge-first,
      privacy-aware translation infrastructure for factories and multilingual operations.
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/work/snow-ai-companion">Snow AI Companion</a>: a child-safe AI companion
      focused on controlled conversation, routine support, and parent oversight.
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/work/oneclick-crm">YI-OneClick</a>: an AI-assisted CRM and workflow platform
      for leads, customers, deals, quotations, follow-ups, and business operations.
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/work/autonomous-vehicle-research">Autopilot &amp; FSD — BFMC</a>: a scale-model
      autonomous vehicle combining perception, planning, control, and embedded AI. I led the
      2024–2025 team.
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/work/computer-vision-qc-system">Pharmaceutical QC Defect Detection Machine</a>:
      an industrial vision project covering data collection, defect design, training,
      validation, cameras, industrial PCs, and edge deployment. I worked as Project Manager.
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/work/maritime-vms">Maritime VMS Management System</a>: a vessel operations
      system for satellite connectivity, bandwidth control, GPS data, and operational
      visibility.
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/work/gardon">Gardon SmartThinks</a>: an archived smart-garden system using
      ESP32, MQTT, web and mobile applications, and a local voice assistant.
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/work/dotx-aero">DotX Aero</a>: an archived local-first smart-home voice and
      IoT architecture using Vietnamese speech, local models, MQTT, and ESP32 devices.
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/work/travel-booking-agent">Travel Booking Agent</a>: an archived travel
      planning system using microservices, retrieval, memory, search, and automated hotel
      communication.
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/work/safex">SafeX</a>: an archived real-time computer-vision security and
      attendance project.
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/work/rabbit-signlink">Rabbit SignLink</a>: an archived sign-language learning
      and recognition prototype for accessibility research.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    This list is now very outdated :). See my up-to-date projects on
    <a href={CONTACT.github}>GitHub</a>.
  </p>
</section>

